{"seq":2,"slug":"event-sourcing-messaging","title":"事件溯源与消息系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/event-sourcing-messaging","wordCount":811,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件溯源与消息系统集成\">事件溯源与消息系统集成</h1><p>传统 CRUD 系统只保存实体的最新状态——数据库里存的是「现在是什么」。<strong>事件溯源（Event Sourcing）</strong> 反转这一做法：系统的持久化层不存储当前状态，而是存储<strong>导致当前状态的所有事件序列</strong>。当前状态是事件序列的投影（Projection），可以随时重建。消息队列是事件溯源的天然载体，二者结合可构建高可审计、可时间穿越的系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Event Store</td>\n<td>只追加（Append-Only）的事件日志，是系统的唯一真相源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件</td>\n<td>领域内已经发生的事实，不可变，命名用过去时（如 <code>OrderPlaced</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影</td>\n<td>通过回放事件流构建的读模型（Read Model）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快照</td>\n<td>某时刻的状态快照，用于加速长事件流的重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件流</td>\n<td>同一聚合根下所有事件按时间序构成的序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"事件溯源工作流\">事件溯源工作流</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CMD[命令\\nPlaceOrder] --&gt; AGG[聚合根\\nOrder Aggregate]&#10;    AGG --&gt;|验证业务规则| EVT[生成领域事件\\nOrderPlaced]&#10;    EVT --&gt; ES[Event Store\\n追加写入]&#10;    ES --&gt; PROJ1[投影 1\\n订单状态 Read Model]&#10;    ES --&gt; PROJ2[投影 2\\n用户购买历史]&#10;    ES --&gt; MQ[消息队列\\n发布给其他服务]&#10;    MQ --&gt; OTHER[其他微服务订阅]\">flowchart TD\n    CMD[命令\\nPlaceOrder] --&gt; AGG[聚合根\\nOrder Aggregate]\n    AGG --&gt;|验证业务规则| EVT[生成领域事件\\nOrderPlaced]\n    EVT --&gt; ES[Event Store\\n追加写入]\n    ES --&gt; PROJ1[投影 1\\n订单状态 Read Model]\n    ES --&gt; PROJ2[投影 2\\n用户购买历史]\n    ES --&gt; MQ[消息队列\\n发布给其他服务]\n    MQ --&gt; OTHER[其他微服务订阅]</pre><p><strong>事件存储格式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;event_id&quot;: &quot;01HX9K...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;stream_id&quot;: &quot;order-42&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sequence&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;event_type&quot;: &quot;OrderItemAdded&quot;,&#10;  &quot;occurred_at&quot;: &quot;2026-07-04T10:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 1,&#10;  &quot;payload&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;product_id&quot;: &quot;prod-99&quot;,&#10;    &quot;quantity&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;unit_price&quot;: 29.99&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;metadata&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;user-7&quot;,&#10;    &quot;correlation_id&quot;: &quot;req-abc&quot;,&#10;    &quot;causation_id&quot;: &quot;cmd-xyz&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"01HX9K...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stream_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sequence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OrderItemAdded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"occurred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-04T10:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"payload\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"product_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prod-99\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"unit_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">29.99</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metadata\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user-7\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"correlation_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req-abc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"causation_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cmd-xyz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"聚合根与事件重建\">聚合根与事件重建</h2><p>聚合根通过<strong>回放事件</strong>重建内部状态，而不是从数据库读取当前字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type Order struct {&#10;    ID       string&#10;    Status   string&#10;    Items    []OrderItem&#10;    Total    float64&#10;    version  int&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 从事件流重建聚合根&#10;func LoadOrderFromEvents(events []DomainEvent) (*Order, error) {&#10;    order := &amp;Order{}&#10;    for _, event := range events {&#10;        if err := order.Apply(event); err != nil {&#10;            return nil, err&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return order, nil&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (o *Order) Apply(event DomainEvent) error {&#10;    switch e := event.(type) {&#10;    case OrderPlaced:&#10;        o.ID = e.OrderID&#10;        o.Status = &quot;pending&quot;&#10;    case OrderItemAdded:&#10;        o.Items = append(o.Items, OrderItem{ProductID: e.ProductID, Qty: e.Quantity})&#10;        o.Total += e.UnitPrice * float64(e.Quantity)&#10;    case OrderConfirmed:&#10;        o.Status = &quot;confirmed&quot;&#10;    case OrderCancelled:&#10;        o.Status = &quot;cancelled&quot;&#10;    }&#10;    o.version++&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ID       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Status   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Items    []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderItem</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Total    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 从事件流重建聚合根</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoadOrderFromEvents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Apply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Apply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderPlaced</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        o.ID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.OrderID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        o.Status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pending\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderItemAdded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        o.Items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(o.Items, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ProductID: e.ProductID, Qty: e.Quantity})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        o.Total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.UnitPrice </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.Quantity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderConfirmed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        o.Status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"confirmed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderCancelled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        o.Status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"cancelled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    o.version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-cqrs-的结合\">与 CQRS 的结合</h2><p>事件溯源天然与 <strong>CQRS（Command Query Responsibility Segregation）</strong> 搭配：写端（Command）通过事件 Store 保存，读端（Query）通过消费事件流维护多个针对不同查询优化的 Read Model。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    W[写端\\nCommand Handler] --&gt;|追加事件| ES[(Event Store\\nAppend-Only)]&#10;    ES --&gt;|事件流| P1[投影处理器 1\\nElasticsearch 全文索引]&#10;    ES --&gt;|事件流| P2[投影处理器 2\\nRedis 缓存热点数据]&#10;    ES --&gt;|事件流| P3[投影处理器 3\\n分析数仓]&#10;    R[读端\\nQuery Handler] --&gt;|查询| P1&#10;    R --&gt;|查询| P2\">flowchart LR\n    W[写端\\nCommand Handler] --&gt;|追加事件| ES[(Event Store\\nAppend-Only)]\n    ES --&gt;|事件流| P1[投影处理器 1\\nElasticsearch 全文索引]\n    ES --&gt;|事件流| P2[投影处理器 2\\nRedis 缓存热点数据]\n    ES --&gt;|事件流| P3[投影处理器 3\\n分析数仓]\n    R[读端\\nQuery Handler] --&gt;|查询| P1\n    R --&gt;|查询| P2</pre><h2 id=\"快照优化\">快照优化</h2><p>事件流随时间增长，重建长流代价高昂。<strong>快照</strong>策略每 N 个事件保存一次当前状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"const SnapshotInterval = 100&#10;&#10;func (r *OrderRepository) Load(ctx context.Context, orderID string) (*Order, error) {&#10;    // 尝试加载最近快照&#10;    snap, snapVersion, err := r.snapshotStore.Load(ctx, orderID)&#10;    if err != nil &amp;&amp; !errors.Is(err, ErrNoSnapshot) {&#10;        return nil, err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 只加载快照之后的事件&#10;    events, err := r.eventStore.LoadFrom(ctx, orderID, snapVersion+1)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return nil, err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    order := snap // 从快照出发&#10;    return LoadOrderFromEvents(append([]DomainEvent{}, events...))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SnapshotInterval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 尝试加载最近快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    snap, snapVersion, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.snapshotStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, orderID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">errors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Is</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err, ErrNoSnapshot) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 只加载快照之后的事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.eventStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LoadFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, orderID, snapVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snap </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 从快照出发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoadOrderFromEvents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, events</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"事件版本演进\">事件版本演进</h2><p>事件一旦写入就不能修改（不可变原则）。当业务需要改变事件结构时，使用<strong>弱版本（Weak Schema）</strong> 或<strong>事件升级（Upcasting）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>弱 Schema</td>\n<td>使用 JSONB，新字段有默认值</td>\n<td>简单字段增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Upcasting</td>\n<td>读取时将旧版事件转换为新版</td>\n<td>字段重命名/类型变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新事件类型</td>\n<td>弃用旧事件，引入新事件类型</td>\n<td>语义变化较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本号策略</td>\n<td><code>event_type: OrderPlaced.v2</code></td>\n<td>并行支持多版本消费者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式\">常见反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CRUD 伪装成事件溯源</strong>：用 <code>StateUpdated</code> 这类通用事件包裹整个状态变更，丢失业务语义</li>\n<li><strong>过大的聚合</strong>：一个订单 Saga 包含数千事件，重建极慢</li>\n<li><strong>投影不幂等</strong>：事件被重复投影导致读模型数据错误（需使用 sequence 去重）</li>\n<li><strong>事件 Store 与消息队列混淆</strong>：Kafka 不是事件 Store（消费偏移可被重置）；专用 Event Store 如 EventStoreDB 保证事件不可变</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与消息队列集成的技术要点\">与消息队列集成的技术要点</h2><p>发布到外部消息队列时，需确保<strong>事件写入 Event Store 与消息发布的原子性</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Outbox 模式：先写 outbox 表，再由独立进程发布&#10;func (r *OrderRepository) Save(ctx context.Context, order *Order, events []DomainEvent) error {&#10;    return r.db.WithTx(ctx, func(tx *sql.Tx) error {&#10;        // 1. 写入 Event Store&#10;        if err := r.appendEvents(tx, order.ID, events); err != nil {&#10;            return err&#10;        }&#10;        // 2. 写入 outbox 表（同一事务）&#10;        for _, e := range events {&#10;            if err := r.insertOutbox(tx, e); err != nil {&#10;                return err&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return nil&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Outbox 模式：先写 outbox 表，再由独立进程发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithTx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sql</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E